queries, four repeated calls, caps 64/256; comparisons are supporting evidence, not held-out confirmation.\n  refs: paper_data.json#/all_programs, source_evidence/evaluation/evaluate.py#L1316-L1319\n32: German cap-64 forest agreement changes from 0.858--0.870 to 0.9924--0.9929 with leaf computation; logistic from 0.946--0.951 to about 0.9963 with integration.\n  refs: analysis_summary.json#/development\n33: Custom sampled development means are nonmonotone from cap 64 to 256: ACS forest about 0.9674 to 0.9512 and German logistic 0.9488 to 0.9137; no unique cause is established.\n  refs: analysis_summary.json#/development\n34: Final table seed 104729, german_logistic, cap 64: agreement library 0.9292158063, split cap 0.3134347097, structure 0.9966775905; structure reference signs 1.0000000000, repeat metrics [1.0, 1.0], stored conditional query CI [0.9961794823135145, 0.9970868158424889].\n  refs: analysis_summary.json#/final, paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/evaluation_evidence/episodes\n35: Final table seed 104729, german_logistic, cap 256: agreement library 0.9753728874, split cap 0.9713265507, structure 0.9966775905; structure reference signs 1.0000000000, repeat metrics [1.0, 1.0], stored conditional query CI [0.9961794823135145, 0.9970868158424889].\n  refs: analysis_summary.json#/final, paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/evaluation_evidence/episodes\n36: Final table seed 104729, german_logistic, cap 1024: agreement library 0.9893991850, split cap 0.9892942724, structure 0.9966775905; structure reference signs 1.0000000000, repeat metrics [1.0, 1.0], stored conditional query CI [0.9961794823135145, 0.9970868158424889].\n  refs: analysis_summary.json#/final, paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/evaluation_evidence/episodes\n37: Final table seed 104729, german_forest, cap 64: agreement library 0.8835736961, split cap 0.2903741391, structure 0.9936678394; structure reference signs 1.0000000000, repeat metrics [1.0, 1.0], stored conditional query CI [0.9929222303417483